1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,817
Babe. There's a ROACH
eating my cereal.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,333
It's soggy. You let it
sit too long.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,600
AAAAAH! BABE!

4
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:11,922
Move. I got this.

5
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,940
Whoa, whoa. Before you
swing...

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,000
I pay rent.

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,109
He's been paying rent?

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,050
Since WHEN?!

9
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,676
Since HE stopped.

10
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,030
Babe... I can explain.

11
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:25,596
Get. Down. Here.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,956
Anyway... who's buying
milk?
